 "story5": {
  "example": "Kate is lost on her first day at a new job. She points at her map. Then she points down a long street: that way! At the end of the street, she points at her watch: late! In the old square, everyone is pointing at the sky. Even the man next to her is pointing at the sky. He is her new boss. \"You are late,\" he says. \"So am I.\"",
